<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-VOUCHERS TO BE TRADED ON BOURSE FROM MAY 26.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-VOUCHERS TO BE TRADED ON BOURSE FROM MAY 26.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonia's privatisation vouchers (EVP) will be traded on the Tallinn Stock Exchange from May 26, the bourse said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The vouchers will be traded on the free market, it added in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
